; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR MANDELBROT v09  -  40 x 24, rewritten for V0061.33   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot: the banner, then the Mandelbrot row by row. The same picture
; as v08 (APPLICATIONS/Mandel-v08.lst), faster: MULTXY + COPYAX MA make a multiply
; 3 opcodes instead of 5, and everything is inline (no SMUL/SADD calls, no LBL/GTL)
; - about 37 opcodes an iteration instead of ~75. x -2.5..+1.0, y -1.2..+1.2,
; Q8.8 sign-magnitude, 15 iterations, ramp ' .:-=+coa*x%#&W@'.
; Rerunnable without reloading.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/mandel1_verify.py, V0061.33): output BYTE FOR BYTE identical to the July Mandel-v08 (banner + 24 rows of 40), 2.47x faster: 45.0 million 1802 instructions (~4.4 min at 3 MHz) against v08's 111.3 million (~10.9 min); a rerun without reloading prints the same again.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 113 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0E 06 00    LOADXI R14 0600
; D 4005 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The banner
; D 4007 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000
; D 400B 11 0A 0A 00    LOADXI R10 0A00
; D 400F 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)               row 0
; ROW:
; D 4012 11 09 00 00    LOADXI R9 0000
; D 4016 11 0A 0A 02    LOADXI R10 0A02
; D 401A 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)               col 0
; COL:
; D 401D 11 0A 0A 02    LOADXI R10 0A02
; D 4021 39 02 A9       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R9
; D 4024 10 00 16       LOADAI 0016
; D 4027 49 09          MULTXA R9                          col x 22
; D 4029 25             COPYMAA
; D 402A 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 402C 11 0A 02 80    LOADXI R10 0280
; D 4030 88 9A          TESTGXY R9 >= R10
; D 4032 A1 00 3F       IFFALSEI XN
; D 4035 51 9A 05       SUBXYZ R9 - R10 -> R5
; D 4038 11 06 00 00    LOADXI R6 0000
; D 403C B0 00 46       GAL XD
; XN:
; D 403F 51 A9 05       SUBXYZ R10 - R9 -> R5              x0 < 0: |x0| = 2.5 - col x step
; D 4042 11 06 00 01    LOADXI R6 0001
; XD:
; D 4046 11 0A 0A 00    LOADXI R10 0A00
; D 404A 39 02 A9       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R9
; D 404D 10 00 1A       LOADAI 001A
; D 4050 49 09          MULTXA R9                          row x 26
; D 4052 25             COPYMAA
; D 4053 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4055 11 0A 01 33    LOADXI R10 0133
; D 4059 88 9A          TESTGXY R9 >= R10
; D 405B A1 00 68       IFFALSEI YN
; D 405E 51 9A 07       SUBXYZ R9 - R10 -> R7
; D 4061 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 4065 B0 00 6F       GAL YD
; YN:
; D 4068 51 A9 07       SUBXYZ R10 - R9 -> R7
; D 406B 11 08 00 01    LOADXI R8 0001
; YD:
; D 406F 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; D 4073 11 02 00 00    LOADXI R2 0000
; D 4077 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; D 407B 11 04 00 00    LOADXI R4 0000
; D 407F 11 0D 00 00    LOADXI R13 0000                    z = 0, no iterations yet
; D 4083 11 0E 04 00    LOADXI R14 0400                    4.0
; IT:
; D 4087 4A 11          MULTXY R1 * R1                     xx = x*x >> 8
; D 4089 17 02          SHIFTMA right a byte               >> 8
; D 408B 21 19          COPYAX MA -> R9
; D 408D 4A 33          MULTXY R3 * R3                     yy = y*y >> 8
; D 408F 17 02          SHIFTMA right a byte               >> 8
; D 4091 21 1A          COPYAX MA -> R10
; D 4093 50 9A 0B       ADDXYZ R9 + R10 -> R11
; D 4096 88 BE          TESTGXY R11 >= R14
; D 4098 A0 01 14       IFTRUEI ESC                        xx + yy >= 4: escaped
; D 409B 4A 13          MULTXY R1 * R3                     x*y >> 8
; D 409D 17 02          SHIFTMA right a byte               >> 8
; D 409F 21 1B          COPYAX MA -> R11
; D 40A1 50 BB 0B       ADDXYZ R11 + R11 -> R11            2xy
; D 40A4 11 0C 00 00    LOADXI R12 0000
; D 40A8 87 24          TESTXY R2 = R4
; D 40AA A0 00 B1       IFTRUEI SS
; D 40AD 11 0C 00 01    LOADXI R12 0001                    signs differ: 2xy < 0
; SS:
; D 40B1 11 0F 00 00    LOADXI R15 0000
; D 40B5 88 9A          TESTGXY R9 >= R10
; D 40B7 A0 00 C4       IFTRUEI TP                         xx - yy, as sign-magnitude
; D 40BA 51 A9 09       SUBXYZ R10 - R9 -> R9
; D 40BD 11 0F 00 01    LOADXI R15 0001
; D 40C1 B0 00 C7       GAL TD
; TP:
; D 40C4 51 9A 09       SUBXYZ R9 - R10 -> R9
; TD:
; D 40C7 87 F6          TESTXY R15 = R6
; D 40C9 A1 00 D5       IFFALSEI SDX
; D 40CC 50 95 01       ADDXYZ R9 + R5 -> R1               same sign: add
; D 40CF 23 00 F2       COPYXY R15 -> R2
; D 40D2 B0 00 E9       GAL SEX
; SDX:
; D 40D5 88 95          TESTGXY R9 >= R5
; D 40D7 A1 00 E3       IFFALSEI SBX
; D 40DA 51 95 01       SUBXYZ R9 - R5 -> R1               signs differ, |a| >= |b|: a - b, sign of a
; D 40DD 23 00 F2       COPYXY R15 -> R2
; D 40E0 B0 00 E9       GAL SEX
; SBX:
; D 40E3 51 59 01       SUBXYZ R5 - R9 -> R1               |b| > |a|: b - a, sign of b
; D 40E6 23 00 62       COPYXY R6 -> R2
; SEX:
; D 40E9 87 C8          TESTXY R12 = R8
; D 40EB A1 00 F7       IFFALSEI SDY
; D 40EE 50 B7 03       ADDXYZ R11 + R7 -> R3              same sign: add
; D 40F1 23 00 C4       COPYXY R12 -> R4
; D 40F4 B0 01 0B       GAL SEY
; SDY:
; D 40F7 88 B7          TESTGXY R11 >= R7
; D 40F9 A1 01 05       IFFALSEI SBY
; D 40FC 51 B7 03       SUBXYZ R11 - R7 -> R3              signs differ, |a| >= |b|: a - b, sign of a
; D 40FF 23 00 C4       COPYXY R12 -> R4
; D 4102 B0 01 0B       GAL SEY
; SBY:
; D 4105 51 7B 03       SUBXYZ R7 - R11 -> R3              |b| > |a|: b - a, sign of b
; D 4108 23 00 84       COPYXY R8 -> R4
; SEY:
; D 410B 42 0D          INCX R13
; D 410D 86 0D 00 0F    TESTXI R13 000F
; D 4111 A1 00 87       IFFALSEI IT
; ESC:
; D 4114 11 0E 00 00    LOADXI R14 0000
; D 4118 2E 0D 09 00    READIDX R13 0900                   iterations -> the character
; D 411C C9             SEROUT
; D 411D 11 0A 0A 02    LOADXI R10 0A02
; D 4121 39 02 A9       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R9
; D 4124 42 09          INCX R9
; D 4126 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)
; D 4129 86 09 00 28    TESTXI R9 0028
; D 412D A1 00 1D       IFFALSEI COL
; D 4130 CA 0D          SEROUTI 0D
; D 4132 CA 0A          SEROUTI 0A
; D 4134 11 0A 0A 00    LOADXI R10 0A00
; D 4138 39 02 A9       COPYMXY M(R10) -> R9
; D 413B 42 09          INCX R9
; D 413D 3A 02 9A       COPYXMY R9 -> M(R10)
; D 4140 86 09 00 18    TESTXI R9 0018
; D 4144 A1 00 12       IFFALSEI ROW
; D 4147 00             HALT
; D 4148 F0 00 00       BREAK

